        "content": "## BE1 input contract\n\nBefore activation, replace the placeholder URL in **Call BE1 render API** and map `render_input` to BE1's final schema. BE1 must honor `Idempotency-Key` (or agree on an equivalent generation key) so retrying the same job cannot create duplicate renders. This starter uses bounded fixed-delay retries (3 tries, 5 seconds); refine status-aware backoff only after BE1 documents its HTTP/status contract.\n\nThe Webhook responds immediately. A successful render API response should include `content_id` and `video_url`. This workflow is inactive and must not be published with the placeholder endpoint.",
